                    {
                        "form_id": "1d9cdc6f-521c-4a53-853e-8573a31dbde1",
                        "entry_id": "dbd4a032-e8b0-3fc5-a721-63a4c86a9dd1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "чалма́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7afe45b-0bf8-377b-998c-222000b9d881",
                        "entry_id": "dbd4a032-e8b0-3fc5-a721-63a4c86a9dd1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "этногр. мужской головной убор у мусульман, состоящий из полотнища легкой ткани, обмотанной вокруг головы поверх тюбетейки, фески или какой-либо другой шапочки"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c198c51-1919-4cb8-b2d8-939794a057e9",
                                "sense_id": "c7afe45b-0bf8-377b-998c-222000b9d881",
                                "text": "Шесть человек, составляющие совет его, старики с седыми, серыми и рыжими бородами, в чалмах и без чалм, в высоких папахах и новых бешметах и черкесках, подпоясанные ремнями с кинжалами, встали ему навстречу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bd7cc57-9df1-4fe6-a530-46ddd13ae62b",
                                "sense_id": "c7afe45b-0bf8-377b-998c-222000b9d881",
                                "text": "Сипаи отдают честь, прикладывая руки к чалме и к груди."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e6b2ec6c-cb24-449b-adf5-8040ea64fa5d",
                        "source_entry_id": "dbd4a032-e8b0-3fc5-a721-63a4c86a9dd1",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7afe45b-0bf8-377b-998c-222000b9d881",
                        "target_lang_word": "turban",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "turban",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "029ced05-8683-390b-bb03-6c265eaaa5bc",
                                        "entry_id": "7e767f83-e4f5-3ced-ac59-252a67364214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A man's headdress made by winding a length of cloth round the head."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfe6f2c6-946b-4e73-bb8a-0e375004d341",
                                                "sense_id": "029ced05-8683-390b-bb03-6c265eaaa5bc",
                                                "text": "Me thinks I ſee the Turke nodding vvith his Turban, and telling me that I ſhould thanke Heaven for that diſtance vvhich is betvvixt us, els he vvould ſvvallovv me all up at one morſell; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8161fcd-6519-43a6-830f-75bdc999b8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "029ced05-8683-390b-bb03-6c265eaaa5bc",
                                                "text": "From India and the golden Cherſoneſs, / And utmoſt Indian Iſle Taprobane, / Dusk faces vvith vvhite ſilken Turbants vvreath'd: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a657a162-5ecc-4d4d-b6aa-c177086fc7c2",
                                                "sense_id": "029ced05-8683-390b-bb03-6c265eaaa5bc",
                                                "text": "‘Nay, I cannot move another step,’ he howled. ‘I am old and my turban is lost. Arré! Arré!’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b44a8060-2ed6-42bd-a7f8-eea4f490891e",
                                                "sense_id": "029ced05-8683-390b-bb03-6c265eaaa5bc",
                                                "text": "The case was that of a murder. It had an element of mystery about it, however, which was puzzling the authorities. A turban and loincloth soaked in blood had been found; also a staff."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cc10dc5-c895-3ca5-a911-7ca3987fa23d",
                                        "entry_id": "7e767f83-e4f5-3ced-ac59-252a67364214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman's close-fitting hat with little or no brim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a8b06d5-d234-30c8-ab26-a7eaf3547a24",
                                        "entry_id": "7e767f83-e4f5-3ced-ac59-252a67364214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The complete set of whorls of a spiral shell."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "456ca416-92d3-399f-b4bb-94735f08ca15",
                                        "entry_id": "7e767f83-e4f5-3ced-ac59-252a67364214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A towel wrapped around long wet hair in a manner resembling a turban."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3fb115c-ceba-4ad6-95dc-779488efabae",
                                                "sense_id": "456ca416-92d3-399f-b4bb-94735f08ca15",
                                                "text": "Towel hair wraps come in a mixture of materials, from microfibre to polyester, while satin and silk are the go-to materials for sleep turbans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e0134e8-dbcf-4c4e-aaba-b9094e8d755d",
                                                "sense_id": "456ca416-92d3-399f-b4bb-94735f08ca15",
                                                "text": "While there are certainly other towel turbans on the market, this one has women scratching their heads in confusion and asking: 'How does it work so well?'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "turban",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b4b2242-baf2-308c-a535-66758d88accc",
                                        "entry_id": "eac4cb58-2fba-3a25-a679-318429ef08bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cover (a person's head) with a turban."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c82ec864-1944-4ef5-84f3-7942237f555d",
                                                "sense_id": "2b4b2242-baf2-308c-a535-66758d88accc",
                                                "text": "While the law did not specifically target Sikhs, turbaned Sikh schoolchildren attending state schools were severely affected"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bfca092-77b3-442a-988a-64ed14b00756",
                                                "sense_id": "2b4b2242-baf2-308c-a535-66758d88accc",
                                                "text": "When we arrived to the shop the man in charge told the staff to turban our heads."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1c36f7c-816f-4286-9147-d4dc231d7be0",
                        "source_entry_id": "dbd4a032-e8b0-3fc5-a721-63a4c86a9dd1",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7afe45b-0bf8-377b-998c-222000b9d881",
                        "target_lang_word": "Turban",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Turban",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "908008b1-288f-3d8e-a548-c49889846b62",
                                        "entry_id": "9dd6b1d5-ac72-3c9f-af58-c6a47262ec7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in muslimischen Ländern und in Teilen Indiens getragene Kopfbedeckung, die aus einem gewundenen Schal besteht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a060c126-2d0f-45fd-b3a9-431f46e4ced2",
                                                "sense_id": "908008b1-288f-3d8e-a548-c49889846b62",
                                                "text": "„Nun muss, wer den Goldenen Tempel besuchen möchte, seinen Kopf mit einem Turban oder einem Tuch bedecken.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c40639af-a9e6-4798-a0aa-23700d858887",
                                                "sense_id": "908008b1-288f-3d8e-a548-c49889846b62",
                                                "text": "„In Anlehnung an den zentralasiatischen Turban trugen die Moghuln in der Frühphase eine Kappe, über die der Turban gewickelt wurde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41a04fe7-0332-4e9e-899b-7a0dec2323c6",
                                                "sense_id": "908008b1-288f-3d8e-a548-c49889846b62",
                                                "text": "„Der Turban ist eigentlich ein Zeichen der Herrscherwürde, daher ist er bei den jährlichen Gedenkfeiern zu Ehren eines Heiligen oft von großer Bedeutung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f52810b4-867f-48f5-ade5-511d8e63ea0e",
                                                "sense_id": "908008b1-288f-3d8e-a548-c49889846b62",
                                                "text": "„Mich störten damals - und stören allerdings auch heute noch - die Kopfbedeckungen der unbekannten Leute, die waren eine Mischung zwischen Fez und Turban und schienen aus irgendwelchen türkischen Kriegen zu stammen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1041bb76-78fa-4db0-8f89-c79ea5da8957",
